    rdfs:label "PatientWellness" ;
    dcterms:description "Holistic wellness monitoring for assisted living residents across six dimensions: mental acuity, anxiety, stress, socialization, nutrition, and exercise. Produces a four-level wellness metric (OPTIMAL / GOOD / ALERT / CRITICAL) routed into the perceptual resolution space for longitudinal tracking and intervention planning. Sequences are calibrated to age-group norms for the 65-74, 75-84, and 85+ cohorts." ;
